# Claude Code Skills — Ubiquiti Firmware & NAS

This repo ships **{{SKILL_COUNT}} skills** that teach [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) how to work inside Ubiquiti's firmware, NAS, and switch codebases. Each skill is a markdown file (`<skill>/SKILL.md`) that Claude auto-loads when the task matches — you don't need to memorize invocations.

**Who this is for**
- New joiners trying to build/deploy/test a Ubiquiti device without being blocked for 3 days
- Engineers who want an agent to own the boring parts of their workflow (CI poll, release cut, wiki update, …)
- Anyone debugging a support bundle, kernel panic, or RAID issue at 2am

**How to use a skill**
Type what you want in plain English. Example: *"deploy this PR build to my UNVR and run the fio sequential test"* fans out to `ubiquiti-artifact-deploy → ubiquiti-debbox-fw-deploy → ubiquiti-device-reserve → ubiquiti-nas-perf-test`.

