## For contributors

- **Repo**: https://github.com/ubiquiti/prompt-hub
- **Confluence landing**: [Claude Code Skills Guide (UDX/4768563289)](https://ubiquiti.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/UDX/pages/4768563289)
- **Adding a new skill**: use [`skill-writer`](skill-writer) — it sweeps existing skills for overlap before creating anything new. Set `landing-group:` in frontmatter so the sync script picks it up.
- **Updating the landing**: run `scripts/sync-skills-landing.sh` after adding/removing skills. CI runs `--check` and fails if the landing is stale.
- **Contributing changes**: go through [`flow-dev`](flow-dev) — no direct pushes to `main`, all work via PR.

> 🧪 Skills are installed by symlinking each directory to `~/.claude/skills/`. Claude Code auto-loads them at session start.
